@startuml
title FE-09 — Configure Weights, Recompute and Monitor Fairness
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
hide footbox
autonumber

actor Recruiter
boundary "Ranking Configuration UI" as FE
control "Tenant + JWT Security" as Security
boundary RankingGovernanceController as Controller
control RankingConfigurationService as ConfigService
control RankingService as RankingService
queue "ranking.snapshot.created" as Queue
control FairnessMonitoringService as Fairness
database "Dedicated Tenant DB" as DB

note over Security,DB
Preconditions: Recruiter owns Job; expectedRevision is current.
Fairness access requires governance permission and minimum sample size.
end note

Recruiter -> FE: Save component/group weights and thresholds
FE -> Security: PUT /jobs/{id}/ranking-config
activate Security
Security -> Security: Validate tenant, JWT, role and ownership
alt Unauthorized
  Security --> FE: 403/404 generic response
else Authorized
  Security -> Controller: Forward validated request
  Controller -> ConfigService: updateVersionedConfig(jobId, request)
  activate ConfigService
  ConfigService -> ConfigService: Validate ranges, totals and protected-input exclusion
  alt Invalid totals or policy
    ConfigService --> Controller: 400 validation error
    Controller --> FE: Correct highlighted fields
  else Expected revision is stale
    ConfigService -> DB: Compare current revision
    DB --> ConfigService: Revision mismatch
    ConfigService --> Controller: 409 conflict
    Controller --> FE: Refresh before retry
  else Configuration accepted
    ConfigService -> DB: BEGIN; lock Job and persist revision + 1
    ConfigService -> RankingService: recomputeAndPersist(jobId, CONFIG_CHANGED)
    activate RankingService
    RankingService -> DB: Replace snapshots with new ranking version
    DB --> RankingService: Snapshots persisted
    RankingService --> ConfigService: RankingBoard
    deactivate RankingService
    ConfigService -> DB: Write configuration audit; COMMIT
    ConfigService -> Queue: Publish snapshot-created event with X-Tenant-ID
    ConfigService --> Controller: New revision/version + board
    Controller --> FE: 200 configuration applied
  end
  deactivate ConfigService
end
Security -> Security: Clear TenantContext in finally
deactivate Security

Queue -> Fairness: Consume event; restore tenant context; deduplicate
activate Fairness
Fairness -> DB: Read aggregate outcomes for ranking version
DB --> Fairness: Authorized aggregates and sample sizes
alt Sample below privacy threshold
  Fairness -> DB: Save INSUFFICIENT_DATA report
else Sufficient sample
  Fairness -> Fairness: Calculate approved metrics and alerts
  Fairness -> DB: Save report linked to ranking version
end
Fairness -> Fairness: Clear TenantContext in finally
deactivate Fairness

note over Fairness,DB
Fairness alerts request human investigation only.
They never alter scores, ranks, recommendations, or application status.
end note
@enduml
